===Format===
* '''Regular Season:'''
** Double Round-Robin format league
*** All teams play each other twice
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
** Top 5 teams proceed to the Playoffs
*** 1<sup>st</sup> place team advances to the '''Upper Bracket Final'''
*** 2<sup>nd</sup> - 3<sup>rd</sup> place teams advance to the '''Upper Bracket Semifinal'''
*** 4<sup>th</sup> - 5<sup>th</sup> place teams advance to the '''Lower Bracket'''
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-TieBreakers">''Click here to show the tie-breaker process''</span>
<div style="margin-bottom:1em"><div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-TieBreakers" style="margin-left:48px; width:485px">
# Points amassed between tied teams ''(mini-league)''
# Map difference between tied teams
# Map wins between tied teams
# Overall map difference
# Overall map wins
# Round difference between tied teams
# Round wins between tied teams
# Overall round difference
# Overall round wins
</div></div>

* '''Playoffs:'''
** Double-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}} ''(1 map advantage to the UB team)''

